Z||000003||Cheever3000||11-28-2001||11:47 AM||||Ask LOTS of questions, request plenty of pics and information from the sellers.  Speed Racer drove all the way here from Kansas for a Fiero that turned out was not as advertised, and they did not buy it.  Long way to go for nothing!  His is not the only such story I've heard, but of course we all know of success stories from eBay cars also.  Just be careful.<BR>||||reg||4
