Z||000011||Cyberkhat||11-28-2001||07:29 PM||||I bought my Fiero off e-bay. Very carefully.The seller did not get any bids cause his opening price was too high.I emailed him after the bidding ended and we agreed on a price after some lengthy correspodance.Then I ran the vin # and it came back cool.I asked him for more photos which he supplied.After all that I was satisfied so I took the out of state trip to Indiana to buy it.It turned out to be exactly how he described it.Everyone happy.Bought car.Carefully!||||reg||1
